{"id": 9722, "url": "https://www.camplife.com/campground/CJ+Strike+Area+-+Scout+Park", "read": "2026-10-14", "ref": ["name", "CJ+Strike+Area+-+Scout+Park"], "record": {"images": [{"id": 1543430, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/560/images/gallery/1_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 1"}, {"id": 1549914, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/560/images/gallery/2_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 2"}, {"id": 1549915, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/560/images/gallery/3_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 3"}, {"id": 1549916, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/560/images/gallery/4_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 4"}], "campgroundId": 560, "hasOnlineStore": true, "campgroundName": "CJ Strike Area - Scout Park", "primaryAddress": {"address1": " Strike Dam Cut-Off Road", "address2": null, "city": "24 mi S of Mt Home", "stateProvince": "ID", "zipCode": "83604"}, "phone": null, "email": "questions@idahopower.com", "lat": "42.946916", "lon": "-115.977290", "facebookUrl": null, "twitterId": null, "pinterestUrl": null, "instagramUrl": null, "description": "<p>Located directly below C.J. Strike Dam, approximately 24 miles south of Mountain Home.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Reservations are strongly encouraged to ensure you will have a spot when you arrive.</p><p></p><p>\n</p><p></p><p><font><strong>\n</strong></font></p><p><font><strong>\n</strong></font></p><p><font><strong>\n</strong></font></p><p></p><p>Camp hosts are on site every Friday, Saturday, and Sunday at Cottonwood, North, and Scout early April until Labor DayWater is scheduled to be turned on by April 1.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/community-recreation/recreation/parks-and-campgrounds/scout-park/\">Scout Park</a> provides visitors with 10 acres of recreational opportunities located directly below C.J. Strike dam. There is a reservable day-use picnic shelter. Get the latest stream flow and reservoir water level <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/water-information/\">information</a>.<br></p><p>Day use in the park is free.</p><p></p><ul><li>33 RV campsites with shared water, no electric hookup</li><li>3 turf-based tent sites</li><li>Fire rings</li><li>Waterfront walking path</li><li>Seasonal RV dump station</li><li>Check out our <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/geocaching/\">geocaching challenge</a>!</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Fees</strong></p><p><strong>Year-round Rates</strong></p><rv><p>RV site $20/night<br>Tent site $15/night<br>Picnic shelter $75/day*<br>*Includes $25 reservation fee</p><p><strong>Reservation Fees</strong><br></p><blockquote>Online $7/site<br>Phone $15/site – call <a href=\"tel:1-844-472-7275\">1-844-472-7275</a> to make a reservation</blockquote><p>Applicable state taxes will be added to all fees. Reservation fee is non-refundable.</p><p><strong>Cancellations</strong></p><p>If a reservation is canceled 14 days or more prior to the scheduled arrival date, the cancellation fee will be refunded minus a $10 cancellation charge. If a reservation is canceled 13 days or less prior to the arrival date, the camping fee will be refunded minus a $10 cancellation charge and the first night’s camping fee.</p><p> Follow these steps to cancel a reservation:</p><p></p><ul><li>Log in to the <a href=\"https://www.camplife.com/idaho_power\">reservation system</a> and click account/profile name, or</li><li>Call<a href=\"tel:1-844-472-7275\">1-844-472-7275</a></li></ul><p></p><p>Note: The reservation fee is non-refundable; in addition, a cancellation fee of $10 will apply.View more information on <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/about-parks-and-campgrounds/fees/\">fees, changes and cancellations</a>.</p><p><strong>Rules</strong></p><p>There is a 14-day stay limit for all parks.Check-in time is 2 p.m. MDT (local park time).</p><p>Check-out time is 1 p.m. MDT (local park time).</p><p>Only one camping unit (maximum eight persons) per designated campsite is permitted.</p><p>A person may reserve no more than five (5) sites at one campground on the same dates. If more sites are needed, additional reservations must be made by a different person.</p><p>View our <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/about-parks-and-campgrounds/policies/\">policies</a>.</p><p><strong>More Information</strong><br></p><p>Get more information about other <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/community-recreation/recreation/parks-and-campgrounds/\">Idaho Power parks and campground</a>s.</p><p>Contact Idaho Power:<br></p><p><a href=\"mailto:questions@idahopower.com\">questions@idahopower.com</a>\n</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p></p><p></p></rv><p></p><p></p>", "events": "<p><a href=\"https://www.camplife.com/idaho_power\" style=\" font-size: 1rem;\">Reservation System</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/about-parks-and-campgrounds/frequently-asked-questions/\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></p><p></p>"}, "cg": 560, "name": "CJ Strike Area - Scout Park", "currency": "", "config": {"siteTypes": [{"id": 101, "name": "Back-in", "equipTypeIds": [8, 9, 6, 3, 1, 7, 12], "amenityIds": [91, 66, 232, 24, 244, 11]}, {"id": 211, "name": "Picnic Shelter", "equipTypeIds": [8, 9, 6, 3, 1, 7, 12], "amenityIds": [232, 24]}, {"id": 4, "name": "Tent", "equipTypeIds": [8, 9, 6, 3, 1, 7, 12], "amenityIds": [66, 232, 24, 244, 11]}], "maxSites": 5, "encodedName": "CJ+Strike+Area+-+Scout+Park", "campgroundPhone": "", "campgroundAddress": " Strike Dam Cut-Off Road\n24 mi S of Mt Home, ID 83604\nUnited States", "allowFlexibleDates": true, "defaultCountry": "United States", "amenities": {"