{"id": 9723, "url": "https://www.camplife.com/campground/CJ+Strike+Area+-+North+Park", "read": "2026-10-14", "ref": ["name", "CJ+Strike+Area+-+North+Park"], "record": {"images": [{"id": 1543427, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/559/images/gallery/1_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 1"}, {"id": 1549908, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/559/images/gallery/2_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 2"}, {"id": 1549909, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/559/images/gallery/3_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 3"}, {"id": 1549910, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/559/images/gallery/4_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 4"}], "campgroundId": 559, "hasOnlineStore": true, "campgroundName": "CJ Strike Area - North Park", "primaryAddress": {"address1": "Black Sands Rd", "address2": null, "city": "Bruneau", "stateProvince": "ID", "zipCode": "83604"}, "phone": null, "email": "questions@idahopower.com", "lat": "42.952445", "lon": "-115.971910", "facebookUrl": null, "twitterId": null, "pinterestUrl": null, "instagramUrl": null, "description": "<p><em></em></p><p><strong></strong></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Reservations are strongly encouraged to ensure you will have a spot when you arrive.</p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><p>Camp hosts are on site every Friday, Saturday, and Sunday at Cottonwood, North, and Scout.<a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/\"></a></p><p>Sprinklers in the tent area run Monday, Wednesday and Thursday 9am - 3pm.</p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><p></p><p><strong>\n</strong></p><p>Camp hosts are on site every Friday, Saturday, and Sunday at Cottonwood, North, and Scout early April until Labor Day</p><p></p><ul><li>30 RV campsites with shared water, no electric hookups\n</li><li>10 turf-based tent sites\n</li><li>Fire rings\n</li><li>Fish cleaning station\n</li><li>Waterfront walking path, interpretive signs\n</li><li>Seasonal RV dump station (located near Scout Park)</li><li>Check out our <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/geocaching/\">geocaching challenge</a>!\n</li></ul><p></p><p><font><strong>Fees</strong></font></p><p><strong>Year-round Rates<br></strong></p><p> RV site $20/night</p><p>Tent site $15/night</p><p></p><p>Picnic shelter $75/day*<br></p><p>* Includes $25 reservation fee</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><strong>Reservation Fees</strong><br></p><blockquote><font> Online $7/site<br></font> Phone $15/site – call <a href=\"tel:1-844-472-7275\">1-844-472-7275</a> to make a reservation</blockquote><p></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>Applicable state taxes will be added to all fees. Reservation fees are non-refundable.\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font><strong>Cancellations\n</strong></font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>If a reservation is canceled 14 days or more prior to the scheduled arrival date, the camping fee will be refunded minus a $10 cancellation charge. If a reservation is canceled 13 days or less prior to the arrival date, the camping fee will be refunded minus a $10 cancellation charge and the first night’s camping fee.</font></p><p><font>Follow these steps to cancel a reservation:\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p></p><ul><li><font>Log in to the <a href=\"https://www.camplife.com/idaho_power\">reservation system</a> and click account/profile name, or\n</font></li><li><font>Call <a href=\"tel:1-844-472-7275\">1-844-472-7275</a>\n</font></li></ul><p></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>Note: The reservation fee is non-refundable; in addition, a cancellation fee of $10 will apply.\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>View more information on <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/about-parks-and-campgrounds/fees/\">fees, changes and cancellations</a>.\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font><strong>Rules\n</strong></font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>There is a 14-day stay limit for all parks.\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>Check-in time is 2 p.m. MDT (local park time).\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>Check-out time is 1 p.m. MDT (local park time).\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>Only one camping unit (maximum eight persons) per designated campsite is permitted.\n</font></p><p><font>A person may reserve no more than five (5) sites at one campground on the same dates. If more sites are needed, additional reservations must be made by a different person.</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font>View a list of complete <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/about-parks-and-campgrounds/policies/\">policies</a>.\n</font></p><p><font>\n</font></p><p><font><strong>More Information<br></strong></font><font>Get more information about other <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/community-recreation/recreation/parks-and-campgrounds/\">Idaho Power parks and campgrounds</a>.<br></font>Contact Idaho Power:<font><a href=\"mailto:questions@idahopower.com\">questions@idahopower.com<br></a></font><font> <a href=\"tel:208-388-2231\"><br></a></font></p><p><font>\n</font></p>", "events": "<a href=\"https://www.camplife.com/idaho_power\">Reservation System</a><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/parks-and-campgrounds/frequently-asked-questions/\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></p>"}, "cg": 559, "name": "CJ Strike Area - North Park", "currency": "", "config": {"siteTypes": [{"id": 101, "name": "Back-in", "equipTypeIds": [8, 9, 6, 3, 1, 7, 12], "amenityIds": [91, 66, 232, 24, 244, 11]}, {"id": 211, "name": "Picnic Shelter", "equipTypeIds": [8, 9, 6, 3, 1, 7, 12], "amenityIds"